    "sections": {
        "description": "PawWell is a modern, responsive WordPress theme crafted for pet stores, pet care brands, and animal wellness shops. Built with full WooCommerce integration, it helps you launch a stunning online store complete with product quick view, flexible shop layouts, and a clean, conversion-friendly cart. A polished blog section lets you share pet care tips, grow your audience, and boost your SEO. Customize everything live with the powerful WordPress Customizer—colors, layouts, headers, and footer columns—without writing a single line of code. Fully translation-ready, accessibility-conscious, and performance-optimized, PawWell is your all-in-one theme for a professional pet-focused website."
    },
